 "owner_reply_rate": 0.1,
 "reviews": [
  {
   "author": "tanbin sikder",
   "rating": 5,
   "when": "5 months ago",
   "text": "The nicest staff along with the very cozy place! Loved travelling all the way to the seat cafe to finally have enjoyed all the types of drinks and some desserts that we have ordered and not one was not delicious! We loved the staff sm as well and they even gifted us very cute lipsticks as a departure gift! Really really really loved the whole experience",
   "owner_reply": null
  },
  {
   "author": "Nazeem p",
   "rating": 4,
   "when": "6 months ago",
   "text": "The highlight of this spot is definitely the ambience. It has a very nice, welcoming vibe—perfect for relaxing or meeting up with friends. The interior design is tasteful and makes you want to stay a while.\nFood & Drinks\n• Acai Bowl: Really fresh and a solid choice if you're looking for something healthy and refreshing.\n• Coffee: Not bad at all! It’s well-made and pairs perfectly with the atmosphere.\nService\nThe service was good and attentive, which really adds to the overall positive experience.\nOverall: A great local gem in Ajman if you're looking for a cozy spot with quality treats. Would definitely visit again!",
   "owner_reply": null
  },
  {
   "author": "Alya Alnuaimi",
   "rating": 5,
   "when": "7 months ago",
   "text": "the cafe is pretty nice and its got a nice atmosphere to it! both their indoor and outdoor spaces are pretty and picturesque. besides that the outdoor part is pink so i’m also biased to that haha <3",
   "owner_reply": null
  },
  {
   "author": "س.",
   "rating": 5,
   "when": "a year ago",
   "text": "We loved the cafe somuch it was one of the best experiences for us. Special thanks to the staff they were very sweet and helpful with everything and the customer service was amazing . We will surely comeback again ofcourse. Plus they had separate section for women which was one of the best thing and made us feel comfortable as well.",
   "owner_reply": null
  },
  {
   "author": "Marwan Zaky (Maro Zaky)",
   "rating": 5,
   "when": "5 months ago",
   "text": "Very very nice place and they are very friendly with the kids, also so many options in door and outdoor also smoking zone, the food and beverage are very tasty and nice, love the place and the atmosphere but the stuff there make me wanna go every day, we love the place but we love you more 🤩🤩\nThank you everyone.",
   "owner_reply": null
  },
  {
   "author": "Mariam abdelwahed",
   "rating": 5,
   "when": "3 months ago",
   "text": "I ordered caramel latte and it was delicious , vanilla pudding yummy, all drinks are delicious,well served in short time .",
   "owner_reply": null
  },
  {
   "author": "Simab Shaikh",
   "rating": 4,
   "when": "9 months ago",
   "text": "A perfect cozy hidden gem tucked away in some pretty corner of Ajman. The new desert popup of the cafe which gives off Arabian vibes and also offers horse rides is absolutely beautiful. An amazing cozy spot where you can relax and enjoy with your family or loved ones.\nThe hot white mocha latte and the tiramisu were delicious.",
   "owner_reply": null
  },
  {
   "author": "walaa Qasem",
   "rating": 5,
   "when": "2 months ago",
   "text": "Best place ever amazing food, amazing staff Maria was lovely,, I love it..this my 1st time and won't be the last",
   "owner_reply": null
  },
  {
   "author": "KAPIL GOLE Lama",
   "rating": 5,
   "when": "3 weeks ago",
   "text": "I went to the Ajman Port and Customs, where I saw a coffee shop named The Seat Cafe. Their service was excellent, and the taste of the coffee was good.",
   "owner_reply": null
  },
  {
   "author": "JQ",
   "rating": 4,
   "when": "9 months ago",
   "text": "Nice ambiance and a comfortable place to enjoy hot drinks, particularly during good weather. Unfortunately, the customer service needs improvement. The staff were not very accommodating or helpful, and the service was slow. We ordered pizza, but no sauce or ketchup was offered. Better customer service would make this place much better.",
   "owner_reply": "Thank you for visiting Set Cafe. Please contact us via Instagram for more details."
  },
  {
   "author": "Shams Abdulwahab",
   "rating": 5,
   "when": "11 months ago",
   "text": "This place has the best outdoor seatings and it is ideal for winter. Hot Spanish latte was super excellent. Lovely staff. Thanks.\nAnd they open 6 am wich is great time for morning ppl like me 😊",
   "owner_reply": null
  },
  {
   "author": "Rami Khani",
   "rating": 5,
   "when": "a year ago",
   "text": "Hidden Gem!  Seat Cafe in Ajman offers a delightful experience!\n\nThe cozy ambiance and welcoming atmosphere made it a great spot to unwind. The coffee was fantastic, and their food selection was both tasty and fresh. The staff were friendly and attentive, making sure every need was met.\n\nWhether you're looking for a peaceful place to relax or a casual meeting spot, this cafe is a hidden gem in Ajman. I’ll definitely be returning for another visit soon.",
   "owner_reply": null
  },
  {
   "author": "Maitha A",
   "rating": 5,
   "when": "3 years ago",
   "text": "Very calm and quite place, the food here is soo delicious especially their pavlova cake 😍😋, I highly recommend this place!! They also have drive through so you can order and pick it up👍🏻",
   "owner_reply": null
  },
  {
