  {
   "author": "badria salem",
   "rating": 4,
   "when": "a year ago",
   "text": "The service was attentive, and the food was delicious. However, I would love to see more variety in the menu by adding some new dishes. Introducing a wider selection—perhaps including creative appetizers, kid-friendly options, and healthier or fusion-inspired meals—could attract customers of all age groups and enhance the dining experience.\nThe current menu has great flavors, but expanding it with innovative choices would make the restaurant even more appealing to families, young adults, and older patrons alike. Looking forward to seeing exciting updates in the future!",
   "owner_reply": null
  },
