  {
   "author": "Ahmed A",
   "rating": 5,
   "when": "8 months ago",
   "text": "I just wanted to thank you for the wonderful experience. The café is truly excellent in terms of quality, comfort, and atmosphere. The service was outstanding, the coffee was perfectly prepared, and the seating area is very comfortable with a great vibe.\n\nSpecial thanks to Jahed and Osama for their professionalism and kind, welcoming attitude. Their service genuinely made the visit even more enjoyable. The staff in general are amazing and very friendly.\n\nThis café is always my go-to place to relax and spend quality time, and it never disappoints.",
   "owner_reply": null
  },
  {
