   "text": "I love this place! I often visit here with my family, It serves the best Speciality coffee & Breakfast in Ajman Al Helio fresh juices & delicious desserts . There's a really nice chilled atmosphere & the decor is really cool... their prices are so friendly🤝🏾",
   "owner_reply": null
  },
  {
